{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"x402 exact USDC Base \u00b7 after paying, poll /v1/resolutions/:id until horizon_end. PAID ADD-ON \u2014 export the DECISION HISTORY for one subject (an asset symbol, or a question id) over one UTC calendar month: the append-only public record \u2014 claim, distribution or probability, confidence, hashes, decided_at, horizon, and the outcome once it settles \u2014 as CSV or JSONL. One export debits the billing.export.asset_period add-on; the same subject+month is a typed replay (already exported), never a second charge; a failed generation reverses the debit. Refusals never carry rows: an oversized window is refused uncharged \u2014 narrow the period. Another payer's private subjects are redacted to null in the payload. PAID \u2014 x402 exact USDC on Base (eip155:8453) or Scout credits via the credit rail: pass `payer` (a Base address 0x\u2026) as a tool argument, or send `x-tollbridge-payer: <address>` on the MCP HTTP request, or settle with an x402 PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. After paying, poll /v1/resolutions/:id until horizon_end. An unpaid call returns a structured payment_required challenge, never fabricated data. A refusal refunds the debit. Exact current USDC comes from tollbridge_pricing (the current rung, never assumed).","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"format":{"enum":["csv","jsonl"],"type":"string"},"from":{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d:[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?(?:Z))$","type":"string"},"payer":{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$","type":"string"},"scope":{"enum":["asset","question"],"type":"string"},"subject":{"maxLength":64,"min